        "claim": "Speculative: an indexed pocket using contact boundaries instead of magnetism/friction may retain the weak-magnet spare and enable gloved swaps. Drilled strips bolt through existing slots into side capture/end stops behind the edge, with a movable fourth-strip gate providing an edge-free handling point. Wire may recover hardware. Pickup needs accessible unmarked surface; gate is not assumed to lift plate.",
